{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>In the month of the Aviv.</b> But did we not know which month? Rather, thus He said to them: See the kindness He showed you, that He brought you out in a month that is fit for going out — neither hot nor cold nor rainy. And so it says: ״מוֹצִיא אֲסִירִים בַּכּוֹשָׁרוֹת״ (Psalms 68) — a month that is fit for going out (Mekhilta)."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:51:53.493977337Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}